{"channelId":"UCtXIfsEEZulPHDycFOQFmtg","row":["HorseClass",135000,"If you have ever felt as though something was missing from your weekly riding lesson...\nOr gotten a new horse who is a bigger challenge than you bargained for...\nOr you’ve ridden your whole life but felt there was something missing in your fundamentals...\nYou are in the right place.\n\nWe are a community of instructors ready to help you connect with your horse, reach your riding goals, finally feel secure and confident in the saddle, and most importantly – Enjoy the Ride!\n\nYou will meet riders from around the world who are all connected here by a love of horses and a love of learning.\n\nHorseClass is an international, and online, learning platform for riders, equestrians, horse owners, and horse lovers, of all disciplines, riding styles, and experience levels.\n\nBrowse hundreds of FREE videos and our premium courses at https://www.horseclass.com/\n\nAlso find us at https://www.facebook.com/HorseClass and https://www.instagram.com/horse.class/","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtXIfsEEZulPHDycFOQFmtg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtXIfsEEZulPHDycFOQFmtg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:20.922Z","channelId":"UCtXIfsEEZulPHDycFOQFmtg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"2dccca2d01f1c837f79b846a282fa17c3510b09f6319eda18df0c565b31285c6","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"1ec37d36be770744a36b7fd50d2ac32093c72771cf38ac35994a712827dacfe0"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/horseclass","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":90154,"raw":"90,154","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/HorseClass/","observedAt":"2026-09-17T06:00:34.206Z"},{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtXIfsEEZulPHDycFOQFmtg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":135000,"raw":"135K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.yo